    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The Penthouses at Woodlands Grove comprise a rare collection of just three exceptional residences, occupying the entire top floor of this boutique Blackrock development. \r\n\r\nApartments No. 23, 24 and 25 occupy the entire penthouse level, offering a level of privacy, aspect and natural light rarely found in apartment living. Each residence is fully furnished and enjoys a dual-aspect orientation, with views towards the Dublin Mountains to the front and elevated outlooks across the surrounding landscape to the rear.\r\n\r\nPenthouse No. 24 is presented fully furnished by Helen Turkington Design, incorporating bespoke joinery and a custom media wall that enhances the living environment. \r\n\r\nGenerous terraces ranging from approximately 24 sq.m to 41 sq.m extend directly from the living spaces, creating seamless indoor–outdoor living ideal for entertaining or quiet retreat.\r\n\r\nInternally, expansive open-plan living, dining and kitchen areas are filled with natural light and centred around bespoke contemporary kitchens featuring Quartz Calacatta Gold worktops, full-height cabinetry and integrated Miele appliances, including wine fridges. Carefully selected materials, feature lighting and elevated ceiling heights create interiors that feel both refined and welcoming.\r\n\r\nBedrooms are calm and generously proportioned, with fitted or walk-in wardrobes providing excellent storage. Bathrooms and en suites are finished to a hotel-inspired standard, incorporating contemporary tiling, premium sanitaryware, rain-head showers and heated towel rails.\r\n\r\nDesigned with long-term comfort and efficiency in mind, each penthouse achieves a minimum A3 BER and incorporates air-to-water heat pump systems, heat recovery ventilation and high-performance glazing.\r\n\r\nLocated just minutes from Blackrock Village, Woodlands Grove provides immediate access to coastal amenities, dining, shopping and excellent transport connections.\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to acquire a top-floor residence within a low-density, design-led development in one of Dublin’s premier residential locations."
      },
